WEBVTT

00:00:00.970 --> 00:00:03.100
<i>It is the 25th year of the Taisho Era.</i>

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:06.780
<i>Fukurou has been entrusted with Imperial 
Capital News journalist Yoshikiri's notebook.</i>

00:00:06.780 --> 00:00:11.490
<i>Inside it is information that strongly 
supports the investigation thus far.</i>

00:00:11.490 --> 00:00:14.030
<i>Cursed tomes with black auras, Karasu,</i>

00:00:14.030 --> 00:00:18.870
<i>the attempted assassination of the prime 
minister, and now the kidnapped girl...</i>

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:22.250
<i>All of it is according to
Shiginuma Takashi's will.</i>

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:26.130
<i>This is the story of Kuze 
Tsugumi and her determination.</i>

00:02:02.120 --> 00:02:04.390
I will have you bear my child.

00:02:04.680 --> 00:02:07.530
P-Please don't say such preposterous things.

00:02:07.530 --> 00:02:09.150
You're married!

00:02:09.600 --> 00:02:12.900
Yes, and I love Shouko.

00:02:13.320 --> 00:02:17.400
However, the Shiginuma 
legacy must remain alive.

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:20.410
You are young, beautiful, and intelligent.

00:02:21.680 --> 00:02:25.350
The Kuze family is nobility, 
so there's no issue with pedigree.

00:02:26.140 --> 00:02:29.930
And most importantly, you have 
the power to see the auras.

00:02:29.930 --> 00:02:31.040
Stop it...

00:02:31.410 --> 00:02:37.100
Our baby will inherit our ability. It will 
truly be the birth of the chosen one!

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:45.430
I will never give in to you!

00:02:49.190 --> 00:02:51.720
You're more strong-willed than you look.

00:02:51.720 --> 00:02:56.940
Well, that just makes it all the more 
worth my while to discipline you!

00:03:01.360 --> 00:03:03.910
No!

00:03:06.690 --> 00:03:08.660
Get away from her!

00:03:08.950 --> 00:03:10.030
Akira!

00:03:11.240 --> 00:03:14.920
Akira, you still mean to defy me?

00:03:15.200 --> 00:03:16.800
Kuze, get out of here.

00:03:17.020 --> 00:03:19.420
Hayato and the others are at Nachtigal.

00:03:19.420 --> 00:03:20.420
They are?

00:03:20.420 --> 00:03:21.660
Hurry and go!

00:03:22.600 --> 00:03:23.730
What about you?

00:03:26.380 --> 00:03:27.230
Go!

00:03:28.430 --> 00:03:32.110
Capture the girl and bring her to me.

00:03:33.150 --> 00:03:34.950
You can do as you please with him.

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:45.320
White-Walled Birdcage

00:03:43.060 --> 00:03:45.320
-Trauma-

00:03:53.720 --> 00:03:54.960
You!

00:03:57.420 --> 00:03:59.460
Let's go. The workshop is in the basement.

00:04:02.180 --> 00:04:05.810
Just leave those behind. 
You can always make others.

00:04:05.810 --> 00:04:06.720
Shut up!

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:09.100
Have it your way.

00:04:10.220 --> 00:04:13.480
Damn it... Damn it!

00:04:15.480 --> 00:04:16.610
She's not here, either.

00:04:16.610 --> 00:04:18.320
Where is Kuze?!

00:04:18.320 --> 00:04:20.340
There they are! It's Kagutsuchi!

00:04:22.120 --> 00:04:24.870
They think we're a part of Kagutsuchi.

00:04:24.870 --> 00:04:27.780
That means I'm free to go nuts, then.

00:04:29.250 --> 00:04:30.620
You go look for Kuze.

00:04:30.940 --> 00:04:33.120
Don't do anything too reckless.

00:04:33.480 --> 00:04:36.400
Try telling that to them!

00:04:37.260 --> 00:04:38.590
She went that way!

00:04:41.260 --> 00:04:42.720
Search every room!

00:04:42.720 --> 00:04:43.820
You look that way.

00:04:43.820 --> 00:04:45.220
She should still be close!

00:04:45.220 --> 00:04:46.680
Don't let her get away!

00:04:48.720 --> 00:04:49.390
Did you find her?

00:04:49.390 --> 00:04:50.520
Go around that way!

00:05:06.000 --> 00:05:06.670
Was she there?

00:05:06.670 --> 00:05:07.760
She's not here!

00:05:11.700 --> 00:05:13.020
Shouko-san!

00:05:29.980 --> 00:05:31.130
Hey, Yamashita!

00:05:31.130 --> 00:05:32.130
What's wrong?

00:05:41.960 --> 00:05:46.610
I'm so sorry Takashi-san did 
something so awful to you.

00:05:46.610 --> 00:05:47.660
Please, don't be...

00:05:48.160 --> 00:05:48.870
Sugar?

00:05:48.870 --> 00:05:53.740
Um, are you staying here because 
you're being threatened?

00:05:53.740 --> 00:05:55.980
Would you like to escape with me?

00:05:58.200 --> 00:06:00.630
I am his wife.

00:06:01.360 --> 00:06:03.370
I'm here because I want to be.

00:06:03.370 --> 00:06:07.650
Then why? Why did you save me?

00:06:11.190 --> 00:06:14.770
I don't want him to commit any more sins.

00:06:15.440 --> 00:06:20.610
Besides, I also have a child.

00:06:21.120 --> 00:06:23.370
A very adorable boy.

00:06:24.270 --> 00:06:26.370
He's probably around your age.

00:06:31.720 --> 00:06:33.210
Burn it all!

00:06:41.360 --> 00:06:42.420
Kuze...

00:06:47.000 --> 00:06:48.450
There seems to be a fire.

00:06:48.450 --> 00:06:50.050
It looks pretty bad.

00:06:50.470 --> 00:06:53.420
If the princess is still inside, 
then we'll have to hurry.

00:06:53.960 --> 00:06:57.900
You two look for Kuze. 
I'll secure the exit.

00:06:57.900 --> 00:07:00.940
Don't do anything reckless. If it 
seems dangerous, get out of there.

00:07:00.940 --> 00:07:04.690
<b>Fire Extinguisher</b>

00:07:01.260 --> 00:07:04.690
Thank you for your concern, young master.

00:07:05.920 --> 00:07:08.190
Don't call me that.

00:07:09.320 --> 00:07:11.730
Things have gotten rather out of hand.

00:07:13.560 --> 00:07:15.360
You still haven't found her?

00:07:15.360 --> 00:07:17.380
Everyone is searching for her.

00:07:17.380 --> 00:07:18.200
Where is Shouko?

00:07:18.610 --> 00:07:20.600
I believe she is still in her room.

00:07:20.600 --> 00:07:23.580
Take her directly to the 
harbor. I'm leaving, as well.

00:07:26.840 --> 00:07:28.390
Shiginuma!

00:07:30.070 --> 00:07:33.150
What a surprise. You are from Fukurou, yes?

00:07:33.150 --> 00:07:34.200
Where's Kuze?

00:07:34.200 --> 00:07:36.870
She won't be returning to you.

00:07:36.870 --> 00:07:40.420
She will be traveling with 
me to a faraway land.

00:07:40.420 --> 00:07:41.850
What's that supposed to mean?

00:07:42.450 --> 00:07:46.710
I need her to bear my child, after all.

00:07:46.710 --> 00:07:48.640
Like hell you will!

00:07:50.200 --> 00:07:51.910
Kill him if you'd like.

00:07:52.680 --> 00:07:53.740
Yes, sir.

00:07:53.990 --> 00:07:55.240
Hold it!

00:07:55.240 --> 00:07:56.740
Move!

00:08:12.710 --> 00:08:13.880
You're finished.

00:08:20.530 --> 00:08:21.640
You all right?

00:08:22.010 --> 00:08:23.300
Akira?

00:08:25.900 --> 00:08:28.300
What the hell is going on with you?!

00:08:28.300 --> 00:08:30.450
I'd really love to talk right now,

00:08:32.310 --> 00:08:34.500
but I don't think we have the time.

00:08:37.740 --> 00:08:41.180
This won't take that long 
with the two of us, will it?

00:08:41.860 --> 00:08:43.650
Only if they don't give you a hard time.

00:08:43.650 --> 00:08:45.750
That's supposed to be my line.

00:09:02.140 --> 00:09:03.380
Sasagoi.

00:09:05.390 --> 00:09:08.650
Are you aware of what you're doing?

00:09:10.600 --> 00:09:12.040
Shut up!

00:09:12.040 --> 00:09:15.400
Why are you always getting 
in my way like this?!

00:09:16.040 --> 00:09:18.660
Are you that desperate to 
make yourself look good?

00:09:18.660 --> 00:09:22.160
Why is someone like you 
writing novels, anyway?!

00:09:22.760 --> 00:09:25.540
You just live your flamboyant 
life playing around

00:09:25.540 --> 00:09:26.970
and hitting on women!

00:09:26.970 --> 00:09:29.850
Men like that don't need to write novels!

00:09:29.850 --> 00:09:32.170
They can get by just fine in life as it is!

00:09:33.640 --> 00:09:38.930
Novels are supposed to be dark, 
messy, and a mass of emotions!

00:09:39.250 --> 00:09:43.400
They're born from the darkness 
deep within our hearts!

00:09:43.400 --> 00:09:48.440
Only those who can express that 
darkness are able to write them!

00:09:48.920 --> 00:09:50.380
Like me!

00:09:52.480 --> 00:09:54.780
I have darkness within me, as well.

00:09:56.670 --> 00:09:58.500
You just don't know about it.

00:09:59.060 --> 00:10:02.330
I carry a fierce darkness within my heart.

00:10:03.520 --> 00:10:04.670
There you go again...

00:10:05.080 --> 00:10:07.580
Looking at me with those cold eyes!

00:10:07.580 --> 00:10:11.080
As if you know everything 
that goes on in the world!

00:10:11.080 --> 00:10:13.920
I hate that about you.

00:10:13.920 --> 00:10:19.340
I've hated you ever since we 
were Moritsune-sensei's students!

00:10:20.490 --> 00:10:23.230
That's why you caused the lilac incident?

00:10:26.050 --> 00:10:27.540
You figured it out?

00:10:29.650 --> 00:10:31.060
That's right!

00:10:31.060 --> 00:10:35.840
I gave the cursed tome I wrote to 
that overzealous male fan of yours

00:10:35.840 --> 00:10:37.860
and just gave him a little push.

00:10:38.670 --> 00:10:40.740
You need to atone for your sins.

00:10:41.190 --> 00:10:45.740
I don't think so. The cursed tomes 
have finally brought me good fortune.

00:10:46.080 --> 00:10:52.120
They all said they would pay any amount 
of money for the books I wrote!

00:10:52.120 --> 00:10:54.160
I was treated as the most inferior

00:10:54.160 --> 00:10:59.380
of Moritsune-sensei's students, and 
<i>my</i> books are sought after by everyone!

00:10:59.380 --> 00:11:00.880
Sasagoi...

00:11:05.000 --> 00:11:06.140
I know.

00:11:07.150 --> 00:11:10.410
It's not like any of them ever
wanted to <i>read</i> my books.

00:11:11.480 --> 00:11:16.610
They just wanted something rare, 
and to kill someone with it.

00:11:17.160 --> 00:11:20.150
I know... I know that!

00:11:23.370 --> 00:11:26.410
I sought after your books.

00:11:26.960 --> 00:11:27.810
Huh?

00:11:27.810 --> 00:11:31.040
I have been reading your books for some time.

00:11:32.060 --> 00:11:34.740
They're a treasured part 
of my bookcase at home.

00:11:34.740 --> 00:11:36.170
I've read them over and over.

00:11:36.960 --> 00:11:42.670
I'd often go by the bookstore wondering 
when you'd release your next work.

00:11:43.790 --> 00:11:45.880
Then you got your wish, didn't you?

00:11:45.880 --> 00:11:50.020
I wrote the cursed tome you read 
that made you try to kill yourself!

00:11:50.700 --> 00:11:51.690
You're right.

00:11:52.270 --> 00:11:54.040
I do seem to recall that.

00:11:55.310 --> 00:11:57.820
The moment I opened that book...

00:12:00.900 --> 00:12:04.820
A black mass of emotion 
just wrapped around me...

00:12:05.270 --> 00:12:10.900
But beyond that, I could see white 
clouds, and I couldn't escape.

00:12:11.380 --> 00:12:17.340
It was so sad, but it also 
made me want to go there.

00:12:18.140 --> 00:12:20.480
I nearly lost my life.

00:12:20.480 --> 00:12:23.750
But even so, I love your stories.

00:12:24.190 --> 00:12:28.850
That's why I want to read a 
different story of yours next.

00:12:30.720 --> 00:12:35.730
Even if it's born from darkness, 
or warped and ugly,

00:12:35.730 --> 00:12:38.860
there's still love and 
kindness in it somewhere.

00:12:40.160 --> 00:12:45.860
That's the kind of story—a book from 
Sasagoi Touichirou, and not a cursed tome—

00:12:46.960 --> 00:12:48.620
that I want to read.

00:13:07.460 --> 00:13:09.260
You should go now.

00:13:10.060 --> 00:13:12.840
I have some preparations I need to make.

00:13:12.840 --> 00:13:13.890
Preparations?

00:13:14.520 --> 00:13:17.520
A messenger will be arriving soon, as well.

00:13:17.520 --> 00:13:21.120
Shouko-san, you shouldn't stay with him.

00:13:21.120 --> 00:13:22.750
Leave this place with me.

00:13:24.590 --> 00:13:27.470
There is something I absolutely have to do.

00:13:28.230 --> 00:13:31.020
There's an elevator at 
the end of the hallway.

00:13:31.020 --> 00:13:32.790
You can use that to escape.

00:13:33.480 --> 00:13:35.940
Thank you for such a pleasant tea time.

00:13:40.740 --> 00:13:42.550
We can't find Mozuyama anywhere!

00:13:42.550 --> 00:13:45.650
I'll take care of the rest. 
You guys can leave.

00:13:45.650 --> 00:13:46.730
Got it!

00:13:53.990 --> 00:13:55.530
Professor Mozuyama?

00:14:02.830 --> 00:14:04.790
The police will be here soon.

00:14:04.790 --> 00:14:06.070
Please turn yourself in.

00:14:07.550 --> 00:14:09.320
Don't be ridiculous.

00:14:09.320 --> 00:14:13.030
I'm escaping overseas with Shiginuma-san.

00:14:13.030 --> 00:14:15.450
We'll make cursed tomes again there.

00:14:15.930 --> 00:14:19.860
What you are doing is blasphemy 
against books and their authors.

00:14:19.860 --> 00:14:21.840
It's all for the sake of research.

00:14:22.220 --> 00:14:25.950
The result of which will lead to the 
advancement and evolution of mankind.

00:14:25.950 --> 00:14:29.340
You mean all these human 
sacrifices have just been research?

00:14:29.990 --> 00:14:33.850
I'm sure Sasagoi, at least, is grateful to me.

00:14:34.270 --> 00:14:37.350
He was just a third-rate author 
overlooked by everyone.

00:14:37.350 --> 00:14:39.800
But thanks to my medicine,

00:14:39.800 --> 00:14:47.100
he wrote books with the power to change
the world—books known as cursed tomes.

00:14:47.810 --> 00:14:50.860
Sasagoi-san must be suffering, too.

00:14:51.080 --> 00:14:55.240
There are plenty of third-rate 
writers like him in the world.

00:14:55.240 --> 00:15:01.250
I will release the curse that swirls within 
their hearts with the power of my medicine.

00:15:01.780 --> 00:15:03.630
I won't let you do that!

00:15:04.920 --> 00:15:06.740
Wonderful!

00:15:06.740 --> 00:15:09.050
So this is your power?

00:15:09.050 --> 00:15:12.890
I finally get to see it with 
my own eyes. Incredible!

00:15:12.890 --> 00:15:15.010
Completely different from your mother.

00:15:16.310 --> 00:15:17.890
How do you know about my mother?

00:15:18.150 --> 00:15:22.440
Oops, I promised to keep that a secret.

00:15:23.020 --> 00:15:25.320
But she's already in her grave anyway.

00:15:25.320 --> 00:15:26.020
You can't mean...

00:15:26.720 --> 00:15:31.660
Yes. Your mother came to my laboratory.

00:15:32.170 --> 00:15:36.290
She offered herself for 
experimentation in your place.

00:15:39.680 --> 00:15:43.540
Yes, more! Show me more! Now!

00:15:43.840 --> 00:15:45.290
Screw you!

00:15:52.120 --> 00:15:54.800
Come on, I still haven't seen enough.

00:15:55.470 --> 00:15:59.560
If you don't have enough 
fuel, shall I tell you more?

00:16:00.580 --> 00:16:04.540
You mother begged me.

00:16:04.540 --> 00:16:11.330
"I don't care what happens to me, 
but please don't touch my son."

00:16:11.330 --> 00:16:15.200
So I experimented on her, as she wished.

00:16:15.530 --> 00:16:20.750
I extracted as much blood as I could and 
administered all kinds of medications.

00:16:21.030 --> 00:16:22.280
Stop it...

00:16:22.280 --> 00:16:25.740
But she ended up being of absolutely no use.

00:16:25.740 --> 00:16:29.050
Her body was weak to begin 
with, so she soon broke.

00:16:29.050 --> 00:16:32.010
Stop it!

00:16:36.050 --> 00:16:38.260
Good! Burn it down!

00:16:38.260 --> 00:16:42.270
Burn this room down with 
the flames of your anger!

00:16:42.530 --> 00:16:50.530
Wonderful. That woman wouldn't have 
had to die if I'd seen this to begin with.

00:16:50.530 --> 00:16:52.780
Shut up!

00:16:53.110 --> 00:16:54.420
Hisui...

00:17:01.140 --> 00:17:04.210
I love you, Hisui.

00:17:04.880 --> 00:17:07.040
My beloved child.

00:17:10.220 --> 00:17:13.830
I want you to be happier than 
anyone else in the world.

00:17:29.680 --> 00:17:30.850
What?

00:17:30.850 --> 00:17:32.190
Where are the flames?

00:17:32.790 --> 00:17:34.230
Are you done already?

00:17:34.980 --> 00:17:37.190
I'm not going to kill you.

00:17:38.750 --> 00:17:41.210
My mother wouldn't want that.

00:17:41.210 --> 00:17:44.830
She wouldn't want me to kill 
you and become a murderer.

00:17:45.180 --> 00:17:48.590
My mother wouldn't want me to be unhappy!

00:17:51.330 --> 00:17:54.080
I'm going to hand you over to the police.

00:17:54.080 --> 00:17:56.410
Please atone for your sins in prison.

00:18:04.280 --> 00:18:05.980
You're naïve! You're far too naïve!

00:18:06.360 --> 00:18:10.350
Just as naïve as your mother,
and it's gotten you both killed, fool!

00:18:10.350 --> 00:18:11.400
Mozu...

00:18:23.500 --> 00:18:29.500
It seems that no matter how you try to 
resist, you are bound to me by fate.

00:18:35.630 --> 00:18:38.750
Is it true that you saved 
Kuze from Shiginuma?

00:18:39.880 --> 00:18:42.280
You still don't trust me?

00:18:42.280 --> 00:18:46.770
No, Kuze isn't safe for sure 
until we meet up with her.

00:18:47.150 --> 00:18:50.510
Then you should've just 
captured Shiginuma first!

00:18:50.510 --> 00:18:53.270
Where did he go? You should know!

00:18:53.880 --> 00:18:55.680
Uh, sorry...

00:18:57.460 --> 00:18:58.900
He's probably in the basement.

00:18:58.900 --> 00:19:00.050
The basement?

00:19:00.050 --> 00:19:03.530
Yeah. There's a hidden passage 
that leads to the subway.

00:19:04.150 --> 00:19:05.910
He's probably heading there.

00:19:08.390 --> 00:19:11.680
We will go to the surface 
this way. Come with me.

00:19:11.680 --> 00:19:13.090
No!

00:19:13.090 --> 00:19:14.790
Kuze!

00:19:16.910 --> 00:19:18.440
Hayato! Akira!

00:19:19.000 --> 00:19:22.200
Don't come any closer. I'll slit her throat.

00:19:23.200 --> 00:19:25.680
Let go of her! You can't escape now!

00:19:27.120 --> 00:19:29.800
So you're still alive, Akira?

00:19:29.800 --> 00:19:32.190
I'll give you one last chance, then.

00:19:32.710 --> 00:19:34.720
Kill that man.

00:19:36.150 --> 00:19:37.190
I won't.

00:19:37.410 --> 00:19:39.380
You've got some nerve.

00:19:39.380 --> 00:19:44.660
To defy me after wounding my 
eye and leaving me like this!

00:19:44.660 --> 00:19:47.620
If you must escape, 
you can go wherever you want,

00:19:47.620 --> 00:19:50.210
but you'll do so alone, my brother.

00:19:51.340 --> 00:19:52.690
Brother?

00:19:52.690 --> 00:19:56.090
Yes, he and I are half-brothers.

00:19:57.760 --> 00:20:01.270
You really have a big 
mouth on you, don't you?

00:20:01.270 --> 00:20:05.090
But you will never be the chosen 
one, no matter what you do.

00:20:05.090 --> 00:20:09.200
You're the son Father forced 
one of his servants to bear.

00:20:09.720 --> 00:20:12.940
Our lineage is vastly different, 
even if we are siblings!

00:20:13.710 --> 00:20:14.930
Remember?

00:20:15.920 --> 00:20:20.860
Your mother died poor, 
in a sad, pathetic death.

00:20:23.370 --> 00:20:27.810
You can only follow the same path she did.

00:20:27.810 --> 00:20:30.620
That is your destiny!

00:20:31.840 --> 00:20:33.670
Who cares about lineage?

00:20:34.500 --> 00:20:37.400
Is status really so important?

00:20:37.400 --> 00:20:39.940
I also thought I was protecting my family,

00:20:40.410 --> 00:20:44.030
but then I left home and learned 
through my experiences

00:20:44.030 --> 00:20:47.200
that people can live happily 
without any kind of status.

00:20:47.780 --> 00:20:48.910
Kuze...

00:20:48.910 --> 00:20:49.770
That's why Akira—

00:20:49.770 --> 00:20:51.700
Shut up, you—

00:20:59.800 --> 00:21:00.780
Akira!

00:21:10.170 --> 00:21:11.160
Akira!

00:21:11.160 --> 00:21:12.210
Stay back!

00:21:14.520 --> 00:21:17.820
I'll settle this myself!

00:21:17.820 --> 00:21:18.670
Let go!

00:21:22.590 --> 00:21:28.550
I used to think that it didn't 
matter if I lived or died.

00:21:28.930 --> 00:21:32.560
Then you can die here!

00:21:33.320 --> 00:21:33.980
Akira!

00:21:33.980 --> 00:21:34.930
Don't go, Kuze!

00:21:35.460 --> 00:21:41.320
I know I'm not the chosen one and 
that my life is pretty worthless,

00:21:41.320 --> 00:21:43.820
but even so,

00:21:45.400 --> 00:21:47.450
I will protect her!

00:21:55.960 --> 00:21:57.340
Mozuyama.

00:23:20.400 --> 00:23:22.920
<i>Good evening. This is Sagisawa Rui.</i>

00:23:21.170 --> 00:23:36.470
Chapter 11:  "Mother, Father, and Child -Bond-"

00:23:22.920 --> 00:23:26.680
<i>Since this may be the end, 
I want to tell you this.</i>

00:23:26.680 --> 00:23:29.630
<i>The realization of Kagutsuchi's 
wish is close at hand.</i>

00:23:29.630 --> 00:23:32.260
<i>I absolutely cannot forgive him.</i>

00:23:32.260 --> 00:23:36.610
<i>If I come back, I want to see
you again, as a normal man.</i>

00:23:36.610 --> 00:23:39.010
<i>That is my wish.</i>
